          "quote": "“左肾偏小/萎缩”不等于这个肾已经彻底坏了。它更常见的意思是：这个肾可能以前就有过长期问题"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00035",
          "explanation": "Doctor corrects the misconception that 'small nodules on CT' means cancer or requires immediate intervention by prioritizing infection over nodules.",
          "quote": "肺小结节和旧妇科单子先放后面，等这一轮感染/泌尿问题排清再整理。"
        }
