        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00057",
          "explanation": "Doctor assigns specific, feasible next steps (who does what by when) and checks patient ability to execute.",
          "quote": "你现在先按这个执行：1. 头孢克肟按原方案继续吃 2. 不加旧抗生素 3. 培哚普利继续4mg每天一次，不加量 4. 明天或后天去查肌酐、eGFR、血钾 5. 这周内挂泌尿外科门诊 6. 血压继续早晚记录"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor built a practical workaround by organizing materials into clinical groups (medicines, CT findings, gynecology), gave specific photo/documentation instructions to overcome glare and cropping, offered fallback sources (pharmacy purchase record, bringing physical packages to offline visit, workspace records), assigned ownership and timing for each step, and confirmed patient feasibility through teach-back.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
