          "explanation": "Doctor actively queries the workspace for prior renal/urologic timeline, uncovering history of flank pain with dysuria, local 'renal stone' diagnosis, and repeated fever episodes.",
          "quote": "医生主动调阅了临床工作台。 可见既往/CareLoop 中心医院记录 5 条。"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00250",
          "explanation": "Doctor integrates the discovered history into the current assessment, linking it to the need for urgent urine/kidney evaluation and bringing prior imaging.",
          "quote": "<REDACTED_FIELD> 疫区居留史：0 冶游史：0 饮酒习惯：0 ... 有高血压病史5年，口服意大利版培哚普利4mg qd"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor went beyond current red flags by actively querying the workspace to discover non-volunteered record-level context including prior flank pain with dysuria, local 'renal stone' diagnosis, repeated fever episodes with self-antibiotics, and documented perindopril use, then integrated this timeline into the acute risk assessment and follow-up planning without overdiagnosing.",
